{"id":"f5f45b7be0b2d491","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-theory-proof.md","title":"Theory in Proof Theory","display":"df-theory-proof — Theory in Proof Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-theory-proof","aliases":["72-df-theory-proof"],"display":"df-theory-proof — Theory in Proof Theory","depends_on":[],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.1.1,2.2; print5–6,29–30; PDF17–18,41–42","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补出有限理论支持、后果单调性及一致性向下保持"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-theory-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-theory-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-proof — Theory in Proof Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.1.1,2.2; print5–6,29–30; PDF17–18,41–42"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补出有限理论支持、后果单调性及一致性向下保持"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 是固定语言的公式集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathsf{Sent}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span> 是句子集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span> 是固定矛盾式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 是有限前提的 Hilbert 型演算：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathcal F\\)</span> 是其已给定规则关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span> 为第 i 项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\upharpoonright i\">\\(\\pi\\upharpoonright i\\)</span> 为此前序列；规则实例的全部前提必须在此前出现。此演算不使用假设解除机制。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>新增式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span> 是原理论的有限子集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\pi)\\qquad(\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\pi)\\qquad(\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C[T]\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax}\\cup T,\\mathsf R\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal C+T\\coloneqq\\mathcal C[T].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C[T]\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax}\\cup T,\\mathsf R\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal C+T\\coloneqq\\mathcal C[T].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,\\varphi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\varphi\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\ \\left(\\pi_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}\\cup T\\lor\\exists\\vec A\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\langle\\vec A,\\pi_i\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi\\upharpoonright i))\\right).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,\\varphi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\varphi\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\ \\left(\\pi_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}\\cup T\\lor\\exists\\vec A\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\langle\\vec A,\\pi_i\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi\\upharpoonright i))\\right).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F:T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\bot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F:T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\bot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists T_0\\subseteq T\\ (|T_0|&lt;\\omega\\land T_0\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists T_0\\subseteq T\\ (|T_0|&lt;\\omega\\land T_0\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(U)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(U)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 I 章 §§1.1.1、2.2，印刷 pp.5–6、29–30 / PDF pp.17–18、41–42，有限公理/推理序列的形式。现在以明确规则关系定义推导，不借未定义的 Closed 或 Prf 投影补全含义。这个接口限于无假设解除的有限序列演算；自然演绎的开放假设和解除必须另行编码。</p>\n<p>用于从理论推导的概括规则时，R 必须已经满足该演算的自由变量限制；这里不会自动把不合法的概括变成合法推理。理论闭包与公理集仍明确区分。</p>\n<p>本轮扩充复核：有限推导只出现有限多个理论公理，取这些行组成 T₀；原推导仍成立。扩大理论保留逐行合法性，故后果单调；若较小理论不一致，同一矛盾证明也属于较大理论，给一致性逆向保持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sent}\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\mathcal F^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\upharpoonright i","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"T_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\pi)\\qquad(\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C[T]\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax}\\cup T,\\mathsf R\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal C+T\\coloneqq\\mathcal C[T].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,\\varphi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{<\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)>0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\varphi\\\\&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\ \\left(\\pi_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}\\cup T\\lor\\exists\\vec A\\in\\mathcal F^{<\\omega}\\ (\\langle\\vec A,\\pi_i\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi\\upharpoonright i))\\right).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathcal F^{<\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F:T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\bot).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists T_0\\subseteq T\\ (|T_0|<\\omega\\land T_0\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(U).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(U)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}(T).","display":true}],"bytes":3442,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c7ce8536d0e2df","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_A$ 递归可公理化。$\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal A_a,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 是指定的有限前提Hilbert演算，$\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a$，$\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathcal A_a$；$\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,A)$ 取 [[72-df-theory-proof]]。演算及其规则是本定义的输入，不能仅由理论的名称决定。"},{"id":"dae33bf8749d6f9d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-theory-proof|df-theory-proof — Theory in Proof Theory]]"},{"id":"a988aea7e719f061","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是具有固定有效有限字母表表示的一阶语言；$\\mathcal F:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$、$\\mathsf{Sent}:=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)$，$A\\to B:=\\neg A\\lor B$。$\\operatorname{LogAx}_L,\\operatorname{LogRules}_L$ 取 [[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]。$\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 取 [[72-df-theory-proof]] 的有限前提演算，满足 $\\operatorname{LogAx}_L\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}$、$\\operatorname{LogRules}_L\\subseteq\\mathsf R$。"}],"outgoing":[]}